Hobby Django project for a simple RPG game

Ubuntu setup and deployment guide: [docs/deployment_guide.md](docs/deployment_guide.md)

Prepare an Ubuntu 26.04 machine with an existing TeamCity agent:
`sudo bash deployment/setup-ubuntu.sh teamcity YOUR_UBUNTU_HOST_OR_IP`

Images provided by [batareya](https://batareya.itch.io/500-free-pixel-art-fantasy-character-pack)
